# Main Terraform configuration file
# This file ties together all the Terraform modules

# Provider and backend configuration is in provider.tf
# VPC and networking configuration is in vpc.tf
# EKS cluster configuration is in eks.tf
# ECR repositories configuration is in ecr.tf
# IAM roles configuration is in iam.tf
# S3 bucket configuration is in s3.tf
# Variables are defined in variables.tf
# Local values are defined in locals.tf
# Outputs are defined in outputs.tf
